            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "m1Qsu",
              "name": "Tooltip behaviour",
              "width": 320,
              "height": 330,
              "content": "Tooltip (ADR-0017, Tokens > Tooltip): every control whose state needs a reason. Timing and placement from Material Design: opens 500 ms after the pointer rests on the control (fade in and grow from 0.8, 150 ms), stays 600 ms after it leaves (moving to another control switches the text at once), fades out in 75 ms. Centered under the control with a 4 px gap, above it when there is no room below, 8 px from the window edges; near a side edge, aligned with the control's start or end (here: the button's end). Stays inside the window, never takes clicks. Shown on disabled controls too: that is when the reason matters most. Text: font-size-caption, text-primary, wraps at 220 px."
            }
          ]
        },
